  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-1" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;1. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;3. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;4. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;5. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock id="f-2" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;1. &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Boardwalk Bayou Ethane Pipeline, LLC (Boardwalk Bayou Ethane) is a wholly owned subsidiary of Boardwalk Resources Company, LLC, a wholly owned subsidiary of Boardwalk Pipelines, LP (Boardwalk Pipelines), which is a wholly owned subsidiary of Boardwalk Pipeline Partners, LP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Boardwalk Bayou Ethane made non-cash distributions to Boardwalk Pipelines of $8.5 million and $23.0 million for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026. Boardwalk Bayou Ethane made no non-cash distributions to Boardwalk Pipelines for the three months ended June 30, 2025, and $16.1 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Boardwalk Pipelines made no non-cash contributions to Boardwalk Bayou Ethane for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026. Boardwalk Pipelines made non-cash contributions of $2.0 million to Boardwalk Bayou Ethane for the three and six months ended June 30, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The financial statements of Boardwalk Bayou Ethane have been prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfRespondentAppearingInAnnualReportToTheStockholdersTextBlock id="f-3" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;3. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfRespondentAppearingInAnnualReportToTheStockholdersTextBlock>
